    <div class="content-block">

        <h2>How to Measure Your Foot</h2>

        <ol>
            <li>Place a sheet of paper on the floor.</li>
            <li>Stand on the paper with your heel against a wall.</li>
            <li>Mark the end of your longest toe.</li>
            <li>Measure the distance from the wall to the mark.</li>
            <li>Use the measurement to select your size.</li>
        </ol>

